    "title": "收支类型",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202412/ffc5eac105cc8fefd8a788c79afa2979.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p>操作步骤：左侧栏资金-其他支出-新增其他支出</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202412/a4c2c7e8098e6c6bcd37585cc3e1b472.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>然后点击收支类型旁边的+，</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202412/05d67584950e5b3509782c86f33437f2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>然后就可以新增收支类型，还可以删除和修改收支类型。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202412/427eb89ea4032f72412cc16ba552189b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>注意：已关联业务单据的类型不支持删除。</p>\n",
